{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Colors of the Past",
    "steam_appid": 3542690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories never fade. They echo in unfinished songs, unspoken words, and promises broken by time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542690/extras/f0fa50d7f9ce031552e88383f933a5ba.avif?t=1754636881\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the silence of the past, a lost melody waits to be played again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soo-ji abandoned music to escape painful memories, but a mysterious voice calls her back. Amid forgotten notes and hidden secrets, she must decide whether to confront the past or let it slip away forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music you create can be a lament or a redemption. Are you ready to hear the notes of the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542690/extras/304c3efdffbd061d9c240b5e714f8be2.avif?t=1754636881\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>A deep interactive narrative</strong> \u2013 uncover an emotional drama about loss, music, and new beginnings.<br>\ud83c\udfb9 <strong>Music as the centerpiece</strong> \u2013 explore moments where melodies speak louder than words.<br>\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 experience different outcomes based on your choices and interactions.<br>\u23f3 <strong>Quick save/load system</strong> \u2013 revisit your choices to explore new possibilities.<br>\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Secrets and hidden layers</strong> \u2013 uncover details that reveal more about the characters and their stories.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some memories never fade. They echo in unfinished songs, unspoken words, and promises broken by time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542690/extras/f0fa50d7f9ce031552e88383f933a5ba.avif?t=1754636881\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the silence of the past, a lost melody waits to be played again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soo-ji abandoned music to escape painful memories, but a mysterious voice calls her back. Amid forgotten notes and hidden secrets, she must decide whether to confront the past or let it slip away forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music you create can be a lament or a redemption. Are you ready to hear the notes of the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542690/extras/304c3efdffbd061d9c240b5e714f8be2.avif?t=1754636881\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>A deep interactive narrative</strong> \u2013 uncover an emotional drama about loss, music, and new beginnings.<br>\ud83c\udfb9 <strong>Music as the centerpiece</strong> \u2013 explore moments where melodies speak louder than words.<br>\ud83d\udd00 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 experience different outcomes based on your choices and interactions.<br>\u23f3 <strong>Quick save/load system</strong> \u2013 revisit your choices to explore new possibilities.<br>\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Secrets and hidden layers</strong> \u2013 uncover details that reveal more about the characters and their stories.</p>",
    "short_description": "Soo-ji is pulled back into her past through haunting melodies and unsaid words. As she uncovers hidden truths, she must face her trauma and decide whether to find redemption or let go forever.",
